    "hotel_url": "https://www.agoda.com/august-suites-pattaya/hotel/pattaya-th.html",
    "name": "August Suites Pattaya",
    "detail": "Probably one of the best hotels in Pattaya. Rooms were very large and as per the picture given in their website. The hotel is well maintained. We were two couples staying together, hence we booked a family suite with two bedrooms. The room was very lasge with a king size bed in one room and a queen sized in other one. There was just one bathroom that had doors from both the room. There was no tea/coffee maker in the room but on our request, we were provided one with no extra charge. Being vegetarians, we were having problems with food in Pattaya, so we requested the reception staff Joy to allow us to cook in the Microwave in the Bar. Not only did she allow us to cook, she provided us with all utensils that were required by us and that too at 12.30 at night On our last day of stay we decided to check out in the morning and proceed to Coral Island. The reception staff was courteous enough to keep our baggage and on our return in the evening, also offered us a room to get fresh before we leave or use the swimming pool which we did without any extra charge. One of the main reasons, why we would be missing Pattaya is our pleasent and wonderful stay at Hotel August Suites. Thanks to every staff that made us feel that way. The Housekeeping staff was equally wonderful, though we never met any of them, but they made sure that our room was kept clean and tidy whenever we returned. Wifi signals were very good in the room with queen size bed but patchy in the king size bedded room.",
