    "name": "Areca Lodge Hotel",
    "detail": "Located at the centre of Soi 13 near Soi Bukhaoa -this is cetainly one of the best Hotels in Pattaya if not Thailand. You feel really at home here with excellent rooms overlooking a great pool. Rooms are clean, spacious, shower/bathroom and all facilities are good so you can enjoy your stay. There is fanatastic long bar outside the Reception area - managed by the wonderful Nas and his team(San, Sa and La) who take care of your food & drink needs. The very friendly staff add to an already great Hotel facility and having been to Pattaya about 20 times this is by far my favourite Hotel as it has everything you could need.Location is halfway up Soi 13 from Pattaya 2nd record - near the junction with Soi Buakhao which has loads of Bars, Restauarants/Nightlife. As a contrast to all the hustle and bustle of Pattaya the Hotel is peaceful and relaxing and not a long walk from the beach. Highly recommended.!",
